  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 12, 'Mapping across product packaging hierarchy using FHIR resource'. Five record boxes, each listing identifier, description, name, characteristic and association. A GENERIC PRODUCT (identifier MR001) associates to a trade item from manufacturer A (identifier 17801415202675) and to manufacturer B's tertiary pallet (18901415202906). The pallet associates to MFR B's tertiary case (08901415202908, quantity 100), which associates to MFR B's secondary inner pack (08901415202910, quantity 50) — the packaging hierarchy expressed as chained associations.",
